Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "PedestrianCrossingInFog" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :BehaviorAnomaly ;
    :occursInScene :scene1 ;
    :hasActor :pedestrian1 ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :foggy1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1 .

:pedestrian1 a :Pedestrian ;
    :description "A pedestrian crossing the road in front of the vehicle." .

:foggy1 a :FoggyCondition .

:risk1 a :PedestrianCollisionRisk ;
    :description "High risk of collision with a pedestrian in poor visibility conditions." ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.95"^^xsd:float .

Identified Risks for each risk class
Risk 1:
Description: A pedestrian is walking directly across the path of the vehicle under low visibility (foggy) conditions, creating a high probability of a collision.
Severity Score: 0.95